# Cloudflare Pages redirects for the personal site. Path-only rules; Pages already
# serves /about/ for /about and drops index.html, so those need no rules here.
# Domain-level redirects (apex to www, *.pages.dev to the custom domain) cannot live
# in this file: use a Cloudflare Bulk Redirect or Redirect Rule (see DEPLOY.md).

/writing      /articles/  301
/writing/     /articles/  301
/blog         /articles/  301
/blog/*       /articles/:splat  301
/work         /projects/  301
/work/        /projects/  301
